{"slug": "mileage-calculator", "title": "Mileage Calculator", "h1": "Mileage Calculator", "category": "other", "categoryTitle": "Other Calculators", "description": "This mileage calculator estimates the number of driving miles between two locations in the United States.", "html": "<div id=\"breadcrumbs\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/index\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">home</span></a><meta content=\"1\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span> / <span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/other-calculator\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">other</span></a><meta content=\"2\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span> / <span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/mileage-calculator\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">mileage calculator</span></a><meta content=\"3\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span></div> <h1>Mileage Calculator</h1>\n<p>Use the following mileage calculator to determine the travel distance, in terms of miles, and time taken by car to travel between two locations in the United States, disregarding traffic conditions.</p>\n<form method=\"post\" name=\"mileageF\">\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"panel\">\n<tr>\n<td>From:</td>\n<td><input id=\"fromAddress\" name=\"from\" style=\"width: 500px;\" type=\"text\" value=\"New York\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">To:</td>\n<td><input id=\"toAddress\" name=\"to\" style=\"width: 500px;\" type=\"text\" value=\"Boston\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><input name=\"validateID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"123536\"/><input name=\"submits\" onclick=\"validateForm();\" style=\"background-color: #4c7b25;\" type=\"button\" value=\"Get Mileage &amp; Driving Time\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</form>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n\nfunction validateForm() {document.mileageF.validateID.value = String(this.location).toLowerCase(); document.mileageF.submit();}\n\n</script>\n<br/><br/>\n<fieldset><legend>Related</legend>\n<a href=\"/gas-mileage-calculator\">Gas Mileage Calculator</a> |\n\n<a href=\"/fuel-cost-calculator\">Fuel Cost Calculator</a>\n</fieldset>"}